Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.34,0:01:56.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}有其他人感觉到 只想剥了自己的皮…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Did anybody else feel like peeling their skin off...{\r}
