Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.49,0:02:14.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}哈罗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}ROSS: Hello!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.91,0:02:15.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她太棒了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}She's amazing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.12,0:02:19.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}让我梦想中的女性 都变成又矮又胖的秃头男性{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}She makes the women I dream about look like short, fat, bald men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.95,0:02:22.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}过去跟她说话啊 她又没有伴{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Go over to her. She's not with anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.87,0:02:24.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我要用什么开场白？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And what would my opening line be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.96,0:02:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不好意思…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Excuse me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.92,0:02:31.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}别这样，她也是一个人 你办得到的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Come on, she's a person. You can do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.46,0:02:34.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我根本配不上她 罗斯，你说对不对？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Could she be more out of my league? Ross, back me up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.68,0:02:37.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 他这辈子永远都别想要把到那种美女 - 谢了，老兄{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}He could never get a woman like that in a million years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.68,0:02:43.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}但是我们常看到很漂亮的女生 跟不怎么样的男生在一起{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}But you always see these beautiful women with these "nothing" guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.73,0:02:45.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你可以当那种男生啊{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You could be one of those guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.73,0:02:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 可以啊 - 真的吗？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- You could do that. - You think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.81,0:02:49.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}绝对可以{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}RACHEL: Absolutely!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.02,0:02:52.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我不敢相信 我竟然还有这种念头{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I can't believe I'm even considering this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.78,0:02:55.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 我一向谨言慎行 - 快去{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- I'm very aware of my tongue. - Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.61,0:02:56.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}来了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Here goes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.08,0:03:03.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 什么事？ - 你好{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.54,0:03:05.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嗨，唔{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hi. Um... Ahem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.75,0:03:07.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好，接下来要说…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay, next word would be...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.96,0:03:09.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}钱德{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...uh, Chandler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.17,0:03:12.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}钱德是我的名字 嗯…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Chandler is my name and, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.51,0:03:14.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你好{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hi!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.47,0:03:17.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你已经说过了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yes, you said that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.14,0:03:21.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}没错，但我没说的是…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yes! Yes, I did. But what I didn't say...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.31,0:03:23.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我想说的是…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What I wanted to say was, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.60,0:03:26.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你有空想和我一起出去约会吗？ 谢谢，晚安{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...would you like to go out with me? Thank you. Good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.48,0:03:28.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}钱德？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Chandler?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.27,0:03:32.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}他来了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}PHOEBE: There he is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.48,0:03:35.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 我不知道你会跳舞 - 你参与戏剧演出耶{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}ROSS: I didn't know you could dance! RACHEL: You were in a play!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.78,0:03:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你们觉得怎样？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What'd you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.16,0:03:41.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 我不知道你会跳舞 - 你参与戏剧演出耶{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}ROSS: I didn't know you could dance! RACHEL: You were in a play!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.49,0:03:44.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}别这样，没那么糟吧 我至少是主角{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Come on, it wasn't that bad. I was the lead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.37,0:03:47.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}比轮唱好吧 至少可以看到我的头{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It was better than the troll thing. At least you got to see my head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.75,0:03:50.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 没错 - 我们有看到你的头{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}RACHEL: You're right. ROSS: We saw your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.17,0:03:52.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她说好！她说好{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}She said yes! She said yes!{\r}
