Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.96,0:07:18.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}一夫一妻{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.21,0:07:21.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}确实值得商榷{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...monogamy can be a tricky concept.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.42,0:07:22.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}就人类学上的角度来说…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I mean, anthropologically...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.67,0:07:27.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吧，你们永远 都不会知道了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Fine. Now you'll never know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.93,0:07:29.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我们只是开玩笑啦 说吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}We're kidding. Tell us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.72,0:07:31.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 我们都想知道 - 说啦{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}MONICA: We wanna know. JOEY: Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.56,0:07:35.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吧，理查李基 有一个理论…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}All right. There's a theory put forth by Richard Leakey...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.40,0:07:45.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}塔-哒{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ta-da!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.61,0:07:49.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我们以后都要用这样的方式 打招呼吗？我还挺喜欢的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Are we greeting each other this way now? I like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.33,0:07:52.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你们看，我打扫了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Look! I cleaned!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.20,0:07:55.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我擦了窗户 地板{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I did the windows. I did the floors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.66,0:07:59.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我还用了吸尘器所有的接头 除了圆的那一个{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I used all the attachments on the vacuum except for that round one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.21,0:08:00.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我不知道那是用来做什么的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I don't know what it's for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.88,0:08:03.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}没有人知道 我们也不该问{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Nobody knows, and we're not supposed to ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.25,0:08:05.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你们觉得怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}RACHEL: What do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.71,0:08:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 很干净 - 真的，很棒{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}CHANDLER: It's very clean. MONICA: Really, it looks great!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.51,0:08:15.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我看到你移动了绿色的垫椅{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh. Heh. I see you moved the green ottoman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.81,0:08:17.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}啊哦{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}ROSS & PHOEBE: Uh-oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.44,0:08:20.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}是怎么发生的？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}How did that happen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.40,0:08:24.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不知道啊 我觉得放那边比较好看{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I don't know. I thought it looked better there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.11,0:08:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}而且茶几旁边 也多一个座位{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And also, it's an extra seat around the coffee table.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.03,0:08:30.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对，是蛮有趣的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah, it's interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.49,0:08:34.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这样好了，只是好玩…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}But you know what? Just for fun...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.12,0:08:38.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}看看放在原本的位置会如何{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...let's see what it looked like in the old spot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.29,0:08:41.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}只是比较一下{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Just to compare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.29,0:08:42.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}看一下{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Let's see. Ha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.00,0:08:44.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嗯，放在这里 也很棒{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, it looks good there too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.42,0:08:47.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}先摆在这里吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Let's leave it there for a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.47,0:08:51.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}真不敢相信你试着 搬动那个绿色的垫椅{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I can't believe you tried to move the green ottoman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.43,0:08:54.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}幸好你没摊开杂志{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Thank God you didn't fan out the magazines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.85,0:08:56.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不然她会把你的眼睛挖出来{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}She'll scratch your eyes out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.97,0:08:58.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我没有那么糟糕吧？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You guys, I am not that bad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.02,0:09:00.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你有，摩妮卡{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah, you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.69,0:09:03.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}还记得我跟你 住在一起过吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Remember, I lived with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.44,0:09:04.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你就是一副…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You were a little, you know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.28,0:09:10.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这样说超不公平的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}That is so unfair!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.78,0:09:14.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}拜托，我们小时候 你的破娃娃是唯一不破的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}When we were kids, yours was the only Raggedy Ann doll that wasn't raggedy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.45,0:09:20.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吧，我比较有责任心 有组织性{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay, so I'm responsible. I'm organized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.29,0:09:22.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}但我也能很懒散{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}But, hey, I can be a kook!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.50,0:09:26.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吧，懒女人{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}All right, you madcap gal!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.34,0:09:29.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}想像这个情况{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Try to imagine this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.72,0:09:33.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}电话帐单寄来了 但是你没有立刻付费{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}The phone bill arrives, but you don't pay it right away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.68,0:09:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 为什么没有 - 因为你很懒散{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Why not? - Because you're a kook!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.39,0:09:41.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}所以你等到他们 再寄一张通知给你{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Instead, you wait until they send you a notice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.06,0:09:43.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我做得到{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I could do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.48,0:09:47.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好 你让我去采购…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay, then you let me go grocery shopping...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.65,0:09:49.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我买了洗衣精{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and I buy laundry detergent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.78,0:09:53.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}但不是容易挤出来的那种{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}But it's not the one with the easy-pour spout.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.32,0:09:54.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}怎么会有人这么做{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Why would someone do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.24,0:09:59.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}有些人会这样想{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}One might wonder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.58,0:10:02.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}有人把杯子放在茶几上 没有杯垫{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}A glass is on the table. There's no coaster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.50,0:10:04.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}是一杯冷饮 在大热天之下{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It's a cold drink. It's a hot day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.00,0:10:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}小水珠逐渐逼近桌面…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Beads of condensation are inching their way closer to the wood...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.55,0:10:10.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不要说了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.30,0:10:15.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}天哪{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.05,0:10:17.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}是真的，我是什么样的人？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It's true. Who am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.47,0:10:20.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}摩妮卡，你是妈{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Monica, you're Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.86,0:10:29.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我的天啊{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}JOEY: Uh-huh? Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.94,0:10:32.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.61,0:10:34.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好，我会去的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay, I'll be there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.70,0:10:38.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}刚刚是我经纪人{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}That was my agent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.24,0:10:45.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我的经纪人帮我安排 在艾尔帕西诺的新片中演出{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}My agent has just gotten me a job in the new Al Pacino movie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.83,0:10:47.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}太棒了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}CHANDLER: Whoa! That's great!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.13,0:10:49.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}什么角色？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What's the part?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.38,0:10:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你们能相信吗？ 是艾尔帕西诺耶{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Can you believe this? Al Pacino!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.67,0:10:53.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}他是我成为演员的原因{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}This guy's why I became an actor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.72,0:10:56.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}〝我失控？ 你才失控{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}"I'm out of order? You're out of order!{\r}
